      "id": "P1",
      "text": "UPPER ENDOSCOPY (EGD) - URGENT ADD-ON"
    },
    {
      "id": "P2",
      "text": "Date of service: 2026-10-14"
    },
    {
      "id": "P3",
      "text": "Endoscopist: Synthetic Endoscopist, MD (fictional)"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4",
      "text": "In 2023 she had a dilation during an upper endoscopy at an outside hospital."
    },
    {
      "id": "P5",
      "text": "Procedure: At the original procedure, the adult gastroscope was passed into the esophagus under direct vision."
    },
    {
      "id": "P6",
      "text": "The scope was advanced through the stomach and the pylorus into the second part of the duodenum."
    },
    {
      "id": "P7",
      "text": "On withdrawal, cold forceps biopsies were taken from the proximal and distal esophagus."
    },
    {
      "id": "P8",
      "text": "Findings: Rings and furrows in the esophagus."
    },
    {
      "id": "P9",
      "text": "Impression: Rings and furrows; biopsied."
    },
    {
      "id": "P10",
      "text": "Plan: Repeat EGD in 8 weeks."
    }
  ],
